  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: To calibrate the periphery tracker, disable the "Is Active" setting in its
    Parent Constraint Script and start the game and then the "Real" scneario. After
    that, make sure that LaserPeripheryHighPoly's ParentConstraint is enabled (so
    it gets moved when moving the tracker). Then copy its world transform and paste
    it after exiting Play Mode.
